= Requirements <requirements>

The guide @guide lists the parts of the thesis, and the sample thesis @docx shows how they look.

The template uses a page size of A4 with the guide's margins, 1.5 line spacing, and page numbers at the top starting from the table of contents.
It uses the free Nimbus Roman and Nimbus Sans fonts instead of Times New Roman and Arial.
Chapters, subchapters, figures, tables and equations are numbered how the guide asks, and the parts come in the order of its appendix 3.
